{"markdown": "# Donor report: KE-PILOT-SIM

Between 2026-09-01 and 2026-10-14 the programme disbursed 4,085.00 USD of food vouchers. Merchants were paid 3,732.71 USD. 215 payment attempts were refused.
"}

{"markdown": "# Donor report

The programme reached 12,500 households and saved 18% versus cash.
"}
